      ":question/problem": "Let $A$ be a $8\\times 9$ matrix that has $4$ **pivot** columns. What is the rank of the matrix?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(A)$ is the number of pivot columns in $A.$ \n\nSince we are told that $A$ has $4$ pivot columns, we have \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)=4.\n$$"
